    "Your Claude sign-in has expired. Sign in again." : {
      "comment" : "Quota failure reason: the web session is no longer valid and there is no stored token to replace.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deine Claude-Anmeldung ist abgelaufen. Melde dich erneut an."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your Claude sign-in has expired. Sign in again."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu sesión de Claude ha caducado. Vuelve a iniciar sesión."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Votre connexion à Claude a expiré. Reconnectez-vous."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "L’accesso a Claude è scaduto. Accedi di nuovo."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Claude のサインインの有効期限が切れました。もう一度サインインしてください。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Seu login no Claude expirou. Entre novamente."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的 Claude 登录已过期，请重新登录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your subscription reports how much of a window is used, not a token cap, so these are percentages." : {
      "comment" : "Note under the quota cards explaining why they show percentages rather than token counts.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dein Abo meldet, wie viel eines Fensters verbraucht ist, kein Token-Limit — deshalb stehen hier Prozente."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your subscription reports how much of a window is used, not a token cap, so these are percentages."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu suscripción informa qué parte de una ventana se ha usado, no un límite de tokens, por eso aquí van porcentajes."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Votre abonnement indique quelle part d’une fenêtre est consommée, pas un plafond de tokens — d’où les pourcentages."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il tuo abbonamento comunica quanta parte di una finestra è stata usata, non un limite di token: per questo qui ci sono percentuali."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "サブスクリプションが返すのはウィンドウの消費割合であってトークンの上限ではないため、ここは百分率です。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sua assinatura informa quanto de uma janela foi usado, não um limite de tokens, por isso aqui são porcentagens."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的订阅报告的是某个窗口用掉了多少，而不是 token 上限，所以这里显示百分比。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "claude.ai did not return the expected data. If you are signing in, make sure you are fully signed in before continuing." : {
      "comment" : "Quota failure reason: the page was read but was not the expected shape. claude.ai is a host name, keep it.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "claude.ai hat nicht die erwarteten Daten zurückgegeben. Wenn du dich gerade anmeldest, stelle sicher, dass die Anmeldung vollständig abgeschlossen ist, bevor du fortfährst."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "claude.ai did not return the expected data. If you are signing in, make sure you are fully signed in before continuing."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "claude.ai no devolvió los datos esperados. Si estás iniciando sesión, asegúrate de haberla completado antes de continuar."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "claude.ai n’a pas renvoyé les données attendues. Si vous êtes en train de vous connecter, assurez-vous que la connexion est terminée avant de continuer."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "claude.ai non ha restituito i dati previsti. Se stai effettuando l’accesso, assicurati di averlo completato prima di continuare."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "claude.ai から想定したデータが返りませんでした。サインイン中の場合は、完全にサインインしてから続けてください。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "claude.ai não retornou os dados esperados. Se você estiver entrando na conta, conclua o login antes de continuar."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "claude.ai 未返回预期的数据。如果你正在登录，请先完成登录再继续。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
